API keys stored in KMS; injected at runtime via IAM role to EC2.

Secrets never logged; structured logs scrubber in gateway.

Strict IP allowlist if exchange supports.

Separate prod/stage keys and infra accounts.

Rate limiters per route; exponential backoff with jitter (max 2s).

Kill switch: ENV flag STRATEGY_ENABLED=false disables new bundles but keeps hedging live.